// №966 boundary pin B13 (the B7 line — the owner decisions 13–14.11:
// the flow output is gated on ONE axis, the integrity half is measured
// separately): the flow ends in MODEL output — public, untrusted — and
// that is the language's primary idiom (p100_mcp_echo, n5_html_tender,
// the self-hosted parser and lexer).
// CURRENT behavior (the owner decision, pinned so it cannot move
// silently): mlog check PASSES — the confidentiality axis does not
// refuse an untrusted-PUBLIC flow output, and the integrity half is NOT
// gated on the flow edge (the Flow arm reads seen.conf, never
// seen.integrity). The measured price of the other choice and the three
// candidate idiom forms live in ADR-0154 §13 (Proposed) and
// docs/threat-model.md row B13.
pattern Summarize(x: String) -> String { return call_llm("summarize", x) }
flow Main { input: String = "doc" -> Summarize -> output }
